      "lines": [
        "Convolutional Layer: Parameters to Learn",
        "• Parameter sharing significantly reduces",
        "number of parameters to learn and so",
        "storage requirements",
        "• Sparse (rather than full) connectivity",
        "also significantly reduces the number of",
        "computational operations required",
        "https://www.jefkine.com/general/2016/09/05/backpropagation-in-convolutional-neural-networks/"
